@startuml get_assigned_students
title Get Assigned Students - UML Sequence Diagram

hide footbox

actor Tutor
participant API
participant GetAssignedStudentsHandler
database Database

Tutor -> API: GET /api/tutors/me/students
API -> GetAssignedStudentsHandler: GetAssignedStudentsQuery
GetAssignedStudentsHandler -> Database: Find Tutor by UserAccountId
GetAssignedStudentsHandler -> Database: Get active/non-ended agreements + students
Database --> GetAssignedStudentsHandler: Students
GetAssignedStudentsHandler --> API: AssignedStudentResponse[]
API --> Tutor: 200 OK

@enduml
